<title>USA: Movie Gallery COO resigns.</title>
<headline>Movie Gallery COO resigns.</headline>
<dateline>DOTHAN, Ala. 1997-03-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Movie Gallery Inc said Friday that Charles Wyse, chief operating officer, resigned, effective immediately, to pursue other business interests.</p>
<p>The company said J. T. Malugen, chairman and chief executive, has assumed day-to-day responsibility of store operations.</p>
